$\begin{aligned}$0.1 $\mathrm{M}\left(\mathrm{Al}_{2} \mathrm{SO}_{4}\right)_{3}$>0.1 $\mathrm{M} \mathrm{KCl}$&>0.1 $\mathrm{M} \mathrm{MgCl}_{2}$\\
&>0.1 $\mathrm{M} \mathrm{BaCl}_{2}
